{"createdAt":"2025-07-15T09:47:30.879Z","updatedAt":"2025-08-01T11:27:44.098Z","id":"pxszMUXuSbNmEz33","name":"import-data_correction","active":false,"isArchived":false,"nodes":[{"parameters":{"content":"## Consignes\n\nCe workflow est appelé par votre analyste. Il recoit en input:\n- ticker\n- date\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"asset_ticker\": \"AGG\",\n    \"date\": \"2025-01-03\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n\n1. Selon le ticker vous importez le bon csv avec un noeud read/write\n2. Utiliser un noeud de conversion pour parser les items\n3. Selon la date, utilisez un noeud \"filter\" pour ne renvoyer que les items avant cette date\n4. On limitera le nombre d'item maximum à 200 avec un noeud \"Limit\"\n\n\nAinsi: Lorsque votre agent appel cet outil, il ne recoit que les données qu'il aura demand.","height":540,"width":1080,"color":4},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[-80,-680],"id":"7fa4a4b2-af2b-4a43-b899-b78325ee86e2","name":"Sticky Note"},{"parameters":{"workflowInputs":{"values":[{"name":"asset_ticker"},{"name":"date"}]}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger","typeVersion":1.1,"position":[-40,-40],"id":"04c12f19-422c-4945-84a7-5ff13bed92ee","name":"When Executed by Another Workflow"},{"parameters":{"fileSelector":"=/home/node/files/exercices/data_manipulation/preprocessed-datasets/**{{ $json.asset_ticker }}.csv","options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile","typeVersion":1,"position":[200,-40],"id":"81213d3d-fe09-403a-a789-fba56394396d","name":"Read/Write Files from Disk"},{"parameters":{"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile","typeVersion":1,"position":[420,-40],"id":"a823e0ca-339c-43b3-bcaf-0a1de9763f09","name":"Extract from File"},{"parameters":{"conditions":{"options":{"caseSensitive":true,"leftValue":"","typeValidation":"strict","version":2},"conditions":[{"id":"03618f5f-3d5b-4b1e-835c-ba820c6767d3","leftValue":"={{ $json['﻿﻿date'] }}","rightValue":"={{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.date }}","operato